#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0324 expect=skipped domain=PC
#note "PCLLOQ is not declared. Since the R-4.11 hoist (2026-09-12 terminal review, MEDIUM-1) the limit column is in Requirements.Variables.All, so the rule reports an auditable SKIPPED naming PCLLOQ instead of running to silence - a skip is better than a silenced run, and NO finding changes: the Check is a pure conjunction since the R-5.25 split, so no row could ever fire without the limit. Row 1 carries a numeric PCORRES and no 'BLQ' token - data that WOULD fire if a PCLLOQ above 2.5 were present."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset PC class=FINDINGS label="Pharmacokinetic Concentrations"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col PCSEQ    type=Num
col PCTESTCD type=Char
col PCORRES  type=Char
col PCSTRESC type=Char
---
S1 | PC | 001 | 1 | DRUGX | 2.5 | 2.5
